# Wave 2 bid-aware E[Q] sweep tensors (~37 MB each per 5-seed run, ~270 MB total).
# Reproducible from w42/book_validation_v1/wave2/bid_aware_atlas/manifest.json
# command lines. The joined bid_aware_actions.csv and validation_check.csv are
# committed; per-bid .pt files are not.
w42/book_validation_v1/wave2/bid_aware_atlas/eq_pdf_seeds*.pt

# Beads / Dolt files (added by bd init)
.dolt/
*.db
.beads-credential-key
arena/results/

# Run-artifacts policy, amended 2026-07-15 (wiki/decisions/run-artifacts-policy.md):
# bulk measurements never enter git. Receipts stay committed (summary.json,
# pooled *.txt, plots, *.metrics.json); game-level rows, decision ledgers, and
# trained heads live on disk and on HuggingFace (wiki/topics/huggingface-assets.md).
champion/evidence/**/per_game.csv
champion/evidence/**/*.jsonl
otis/models/*.pt
